#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:22
#: 65587345284a4cada8f1e20fe49adfcd
msgid "Pico **Enterprise** and Pico **consumer** are not the same SKU:"
msgstr "Pico **企业版** 与 Pico **消费版** 不是同一 SKU："

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:24
