msgid ""
"They use **different headset Apps** — do not install one App and expect it "
"to cover both."
msgstr "它们使用**不同的头显 App** — 不要安装一个 App 就期望同时覆盖两者。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:27
#: 633cd5edc8b341daa49ebcc691f24a75
msgid ""
"fa-py-libraries documents XRoboToolkit as “XRoboToolkit App + PC Service” vs"
" browser WebXR (`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`). It does not publish "
"store links or ADB steps for either Pico edition."
msgstr ""
"fa-py-libraries 将 XRoboToolkit 记为「XRoboToolkit App + PC Service」对比浏览器 "
"WebXR（`./run.sh vr` / `./run.sh vr-xrt`）。它不为任一 Pico 版本提供商店链接或 ADB 步骤。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/1-vr_pose_publisher.md:30
#: 9cb9d77851714f3c9962ae3e3cc39aef
