#: 24b9f1d7913a4596ad2c2b28c8906fe1
msgid ""
"**Pico Enterprise:** USB shared networking (USB 网络共享) can put the headset "
"and PC on one network. Use the headset UI; no ADB steps here."
msgstr "**Pico 企业版：** USB 网络共享可将头显与电脑放在同一网络。使用头显界面；此处不写 ADB 步骤。"

